{"seq":3,"slug":"routing-ab-test","title":"路由策略 A/B 实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/acquiring-smart-routing-auth/auth-analytics-ops/routing-ab-test","wordCount":3202,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"路由策略-a-b-实验\">路由策略 A/B 实验</h1><p>前三篇把路由、验真、报文的所有改动都建立起来了，这一篇解决最后一个问题：怎么知道改动真的有效。这个问题在路由场景下格外难，因为路由实验面对的干扰比典型的 A/B 测试多得多——通道自身在变化、流量构成在漂移、同一个用户不能同时走两条路径、而批准率的差异往往只有几个基点。用普通的产品实验方法论来做路由实验，几乎注定得出错误结论。</p>\n<p>本文讲路由实验特有的四个难题：分流单元怎么选、干扰怎么控制、样本量怎么估、以及净收益怎么算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-路由实验的四个特殊性\">核心概念：路由实验的四个特殊性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特殊性</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n<th>对实验设计的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分流单元受限</td>\n<td>同一用户不宜走两条通道</td>\n<td>需要会话级或商户级粘性，损失部分随机性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果不可复现</td>\n<td>同一笔交易不能同时观测两种策略的结果</td>\n<td>无法直接测量反事实，只能组间比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通道自身漂移</td>\n<td>通道风控、发卡行策略在实验期变化</td>\n<td>必须同时观察对照组，且要做时间对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效应量小</td>\n<td>批准率差异常为几个基点</td>\n<td>样本量需求大，且对方差控制极敏感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二行是路由实验与普通实验最根本的区别。在推荐系统里你可以给同一用户看两个版本；在付款里你不能让同一笔交易同时走两个通道。这意味着<strong>路由实验只能做组间对比（between-subject）</strong>，所有个体差异都会进入误差项。这直接推高了样本量需求，也让分流单元的选择变得关键——分流单元内的相关性越强，有效样本量越小。</p>\n<p>第三行揭示了一个必须处理的问题：如果实验期间某通道恰好劣化，实验组的批准率下降可能被误归因于策略改动。控制方法是<strong>同时对比（concurrent control）</strong>——对照组和实验组必须在同一时间段、面对同样的流量构成运行，而不是用「实验前 vs 实验后」的历史对比。这个原则听起来显然，但很多团队在做「上线前后对比」时忽略了它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[交易意图到达] --&gt; B{分流}&#10;  B --&gt;|50%| C[对照组&lt;br/&gt;旧路由策略]&#10;  B --&gt;|50%| D[实验组&lt;br/&gt;新路由策略]&#10;  C --&gt; E[记录: 意图结果/首试通道/延迟/成本]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[分层后处理&lt;br/&gt;按BIN段/MCC/币种]&#10;  F --&gt; G[同构成对比&lt;br/&gt;加权汇总]&#10;  G --&gt; H{显著性检验}&#10;  H --&gt;|显著且正向| I[扩大流量→全量]&#10;  H --&gt;|显著且负向| J[回滚]&#10;  H --&gt;|不显著| K[延长观察或放弃&lt;br/&gt;避免被噪声驱动]\">graph TD\n  A[交易意图到达] --&gt; B{分流}\n  B --&gt;|50%| C[对照组&lt;br/&gt;旧路由策略]\n  B --&gt;|50%| D[实验组&lt;br/&gt;新路由策略]\n  C --&gt; E[记录: 意图结果/首试通道/延迟/成本]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[分层后处理&lt;br/&gt;按BIN段/MCC/币种]\n  F --&gt; G[同构成对比&lt;br/&gt;加权汇总]\n  G --&gt; H{显著性检验}\n  H --&gt;|显著且正向| I[扩大流量→全量]\n  H --&gt;|显著且负向| J[回滚]\n  H --&gt;|不显著| K[延长观察或放弃&lt;br/&gt;避免被噪声驱动]</pre><h2 id=\"分流单元的选择\">分流单元的选择</h2><p>分流单元决定了实验的统计效率与业务可接受性。三种可选各有取舍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种分流单元\">三种分流单元</h3><p><strong>按交易意图分流</strong>（transaction-level）：随机性最好，同一时间窗内两组面对的流量构成最接近。代价是同一用户或同一会话的连续交易可能落到不同分支，导致体验不一致，也可能因为「同一用户的重试跨分支」污染结果。缓解方式是把同一意图的所有尝试绑定在同一分支上——重试必须走原分支，否则重试策略的效果会与被测策略混淆。</p>\n<p><strong>按会话分流</strong>（session-level）：同一会话（一次支付过程）内一致，减少体验不一致与跨分支污染。代价是有效样本量略低于交易级，因为同一会话内的交易相关性更高。</p>\n<p><strong>按商户分流</strong>（merchant-level）：同一商户体验完全一致，样本内部相关性极高，适合商户级策略（例如某商户通道白名单）。代价是需要足够多的商户才能形成两组，且商户间差异极大，必须做分层或配对设计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分流单元</th>\n<th>随机性</th>\n<th>有效样本量</th>\n<th>跨分支污染风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易意图</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（重试需绑定分支）</td>\n<td>算法类改动（打分、因子）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>涉及用户体验的决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商户</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>商户级配置类改动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对多数路由算法改动，会话级是合理的默认选择。选择之后必须把「重试绑定原分支」作为硬规则实现，否则算法效果的测量会被重试行为污染——重试本身就是被实验影响的行为（新策略可能触发更多重试），把它算进对照组或跨分支会让两组的结果无法归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方差控制\">方差控制</h2><p>效应量小是路由实验的核心困难，而控制方差是提升统计功效最有效的手段。可用的手段有三类。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种方差控制手段\">三种方差控制手段</h3><p><strong>分层随机化（stratified randomization）</strong>：先按关键维度（BIN 归属地区、卡类型、币种、MCC）把流量分成层，在每层内独立随机分配。这样能消除这些维度在两组间的不平衡，把它们的方差从误差项里剔除。对于批准率这种受 BIN 段影响极大的指标，分层几乎是必需的。</p>\n<p><strong>协变量调整（CUPED 类方法）</strong>：利用实验前的历史数据构造一个与结果相关的协变量，用它来调整结果，从而降低方差。在路由场景下，一个天然可用的协变量是「该卡/该商户的历史批准率」——它在实验前就已知，且与实际结果强相关。构造方法是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{Y} = Y - \\theta \\cdot (X - \\bar{X})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0701em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 是实验前的协变量（如历史批准率），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其均值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 是使方差最小的系数（可通过回归估计）。调整后的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6023em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 方差低于原始 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span>，从而在相同样本量下获得更高功效。这里的关键是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 必须在实验开始前就固定，任何使用实验期数据构造的协变量都会引入偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>固定子集分析</strong>：与其在全体流量上比较，不如在一个构成稳定、样本充足的子集上比较（例如只看法国的信用卡、欧元交易）。子集的效应未必代表全体，但它的噪声小，能更快给出方向性结论，再结合全体的分层加权结果做决策。这与 <a href=\"auth-approval-rate-analytics\">授权成功率分渠道分析</a> 里说的构成控制是同一套思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样本量估算\">样本量估算</h2><p>样本量取决于三个量：基线批准率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、希望检测的最小效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>、以及显著性水平与功效。用两组比例检验的近似公式：</p>\n<h3 id=\"公式与直觉\">公式与直觉</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx \\frac{2 \\cdot (z_{1-\\alpha/2} + z_{1-\\beta})^2 \\cdot p(1-p)}{\\delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入典型值：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.85</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span>（一个百分点）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = 0.20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span></span></span></span></span>（功效 80%），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 值约为 1.96 和 0.84：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.96</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.84</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.1275</mn></mrow><mn>0.0001</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>20000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx \\frac{2 \\times (1.96 + 0.84)^2 \\times 0.1275}{0.0001} \\approx 20000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0001</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.84</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1275</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20000</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每组约需两万笔交易。这个数字解释了为什么路由实验经常「跑不出结论」——如果平台的日交易量是几千笔，检测一个百分点的提升需要两周以上的实验期，而通道在这两周内几乎一定会发生变化。若把目标降到检测半个百分点，样本量翻四倍到八万，多数平台根本不具备条件。</p>\n<p>这也是为什么**影子模式（shadow mode）**在小流量平台上比在线实验更实用：它让新策略在真实流量上计算推荐但不下发，虽然不能测量反事实的成功率，但能测量「推荐一致性」「推荐分布」等代理指标，用更少的流量捕捉明显的逻辑错误。影子模式不能替代实验，但能把「策略明显有问题」这类错误在进入实验前筛掉。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 实验效果评估：分层加权后的组间差异&#10;WITH per_stratum AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    stratum_key,&#10;    arm,                                  -- &#39;control&#39; | &#39;treatment&#39;&#10;    COUNT(*)                 AS n,&#10;    AVG(approved::int)       AS rate&#10;  FROM experiment_intent&#10;  WHERE experiment_id = :exp_id&#10;    AND created_at BETWEEN :start AND :end&#10;  GROUP BY stratum_key, arm&#10;),&#10;paired AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    c.stratum_key,&#10;    c.n                      AS n_c,&#10;    t.n                      AS n_t,&#10;    t.rate - c.rate          AS diff,&#10;    -- 层内权重取两组样本量之和，按层加权&#10;    (c.n + t.n)              AS w&#10;  FROM per_stratum c&#10;  JOIN per_stratum t&#10;    ON t.stratum_key = c.stratum_key AND t.arm = &#39;treatment&#39;&#10;  WHERE c.arm = &#39;control&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  SUM(diff * w) / SUM(w)                                  AS weighted_diff,&#10;  SUM(w)                                                  AS total_intents,&#10;  -- 层间差异的标准误（简化形态，生产需按方差公式展开）&#10;  SQRT(SUM(w * w * 0.25) / (SUM(w) * SUM(w)))             AS se_approx,&#10;  SUM(diff * w) / SUM(w) / NULLIF(SQRT(SUM(w*w*0.25)/(SUM(w)*SUM(w))),0) AS z_score&#10;FROM paired;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实验效果评估：分层加权后的组间差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_stratum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stratum_key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    arm,                                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'control' | 'treatment'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(approved::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> experiment_intent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> experiment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :exp_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stratum_key, arm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">paired </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stratum_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                      AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_c,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                      AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_t,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diff,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 层内权重取两组样本量之和，按层加权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_stratum c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> per_stratum t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stratum_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stratum_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">arm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'treatment'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">arm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'control'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w)                                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weighted_diff,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w)                                                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_intents,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 层间差异的标准误（简化形态，生产需按方差公式展开）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SQRT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w)))             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> se_approx,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(diff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SQRT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w))),</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paired;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段查询体现两个要点：<strong>按层加权</strong>而不是直接汇总（避免辛普森悖论——某层流量大且效应小，直接汇总会掩盖其他层的效应），以及<strong>输出 z 值而非仅输出差值</strong>（差值本身不能判断显著性，必须结合样本量）。生产实现中标准误的估计应当用分层方差公式或自助法（bootstrap），上面的近似仅用于说明结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"净收益计算\">净收益计算</h2><p>批准率提升不是决策的终点。一个提升批准率的策略可能同时抬高成本、引入欺诈、或增加拒付。净收益必须把这四类效应都算进去。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五项差值\">五项差值</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>Net</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>成功交易数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单笔毛利</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>通道成本</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>欺诈损失</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>拒付损失</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>重试成本</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\text{Net} = \\Delta(\\text{成功交易数} \\times \\text{单笔毛利}) - \\Delta(\\text{通道成本}) - \\Delta(\\text{欺诈损失}) - \\Delta(\\text{拒付损失}) - \\Delta(\\text{重试成本})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成功交易数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单笔毛利</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">通道成本</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">欺诈损失</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">拒付损失</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重试成本</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>逐项看：成功交易数增加带来毛利，这是收益的主体；通道成本增加来自换到更贵通道或更多重试请求；欺诈损失来自放宽验真导致的欺诈通过；拒付损失来自描述符或 DCC 变化引发的争议；重试成本是额外的授权请求费用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>效应项</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>常见误判</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成功交易数</td>\n<td>意图级成功率 × 流量</td>\n<td>用请求级口径会高估收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通道成本</td>\n<td>实际通道费率 × 金额，按分支汇总</td>\n<td>忽略隐性成本（资金占用、罚金）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欺诈损失</td>\n<td>实验期内的欺诈确认金额</td>\n<td>欺诈有延迟，短期观察会低估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒付损失</td>\n<td>争议金额 + 罚金</td>\n<td>拒付在交易后几十天出现，需等待期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试成本</td>\n<td>尝试次数 × 请求费</td>\n<td>忽略信誉成本（见重试篇的 amplification）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行与最后两列的「延迟」是路由实验最实际的困难：<strong>拒付与欺诈的确认周期长于实验周期</strong>。一个在两周实验期内看起来净收益为正的策略，可能因为拒付在第四周集中出现而实际为负。可行的应对是：实验期结束时先看通过率与技术指标的结论，同时把拒付与欺诈纳入一个更长的观察窗（例如实验结束后持续跟踪 60 天该分组交易的表现），在长窗结论出来前只做有限扩量而不全量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结论的稳定性\">结论的稳定性</h2><p>即使实验得出显著结论，也需要检验结论的稳定性再决策。稳定性检验的常用手段是把实验期切成若干子窗口，看效应是否一致——如果效应只出现在某一个子窗口（例如只在第一周），很可能是某个通道在那一周恰好异常，而非策略本身的持续效果。另一个手段是按分流单元之外的分组（例如不同地区、不同 BIN 段）看效应方向是否一致，方向矛盾说明策略的效果依赖于未建模的条件，需要补充分析再全量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"预先注册决策规则\">预先注册决策规则</h3><p>最后一条纪律是<strong>预先注册决策规则</strong>。在实验开始前就写明「加权效应 &gt; 0 且 z &gt; 1.96 则全量，效应 &lt; 0 且 z &gt; 1.96 则回滚，否则维持现状并延长观察」，避免在看到结果之后再决定阈值。这与 <a href=\"../psp-acquirer-routing/dynamic-weight-failover\">动态权重、灰度与故障转移</a> 里说的「回滚条件必须预先定义」是同一条纪律：判断标准在被观测数据污染之前就固定下来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>路由实验只能做组间对比（同一笔交易无法同时观测两种策略），因此分流单元的选择与方差控制决定实验的可行性。</li>\n<li>分流单元按改动类型选：算法类用会话级或交易意图级，商户配置类用商户级；重试必须绑定原分支，否则会污染结果。</li>\n<li>方差控制三件套：分层随机化（按 BIN/卡类型/币种）、CUPED 类协变量调整（协变量必须实验前固定）、固定子集分析。</li>\n<li>样本量需求通常很大；检测一个百分点差异在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.85</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span></span> 下约需每组两万笔，小流量平台只能用影子模式先筛逻辑错误。</li>\n<li>评估必须按层加权（避免辛普森悖论）并输出显著性，不能只看差值。</li>\n<li>净收益要同时计算成功交易毛利、通道成本、欺诈损失、拒付损失、重试成本五项的差值。</li>\n<li>欺诈与拒付确认周期长于实验期，需要延长观察窗；实验期结论只支持有限扩量。</li>\n<li>决策规则要在实验前预先注册，并检验效应在子窗口与子分组上的一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关篇目：指标口径与失败分类是实验度量的基础，见 <a href=\"auth-approval-rate-analytics\">授权成功率分渠道分析</a>；归因结论需要通过实验验证，见 <a href=\"issuer-debug-code-mapping\">拒付码归因与映射</a>；灰度阶梯与自动回滚的工程实现见 <a href=\"../psp-acquirer-routing/dynamic-weight-failover\">动态权重、灰度与故障转移</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路由策略 A/B 实验","id":"路由策略-a-b-实验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：路由实验的四个特殊性","id":"核心概念-路由实验的四个特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"分流单元的选择","id":"分流单元的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"三种分流单元","id":"三种分流单元"},{"level":2,"text":"方差控制","id":"方差控制"},{"level":3,"text":"三种方差控制手段","id":"三种方差控制手段"},{"level":2,"text":"样本量估算","id":"样本量估算"},{"level":3,"text":"公式与直觉","id":"公式与直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"净收益计算","id":"净收益计算"},{"level":3,"text":"五项差值","id":"五项差值"},{"level":2,"text":"结论的稳定性","id":"结论的稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"预先注册决策规则","id":"预先注册决策规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"拒付码归因与映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/acquiring-smart-routing-auth/auth-analytics-ops/issuer-debug-code-mapping"},"next":null}